          "note": "One C-O bond lengthens as the other shortens, in antiphase — often cited as ν₄ of the free formate ion. The position of this stretch is itself sensitive to binding geometry.",
          "ir_active": true,
          "raman_active": null,
          "tags": ["site-sensitive"],
          "reference": []
        },
        {
